WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:04.170
Welcome to the final great Saga of One Piece.

00:00:04.170 --> 00:00:05.830
We have made it!

00:00:05.830 --> 00:00:08.130
We're officially in the end game now.

00:00:08.130 --> 00:00:14.370
The marines demonstrate their immense power,
Shanks finally reveals his true face and Sabo

00:00:14.370 --> 00:00:19.270
has risen to almost as much fame as Luffy
has across the world.

00:00:19.270 --> 00:00:22.610
In other words pure one piece greatness.

00:00:22.610 --> 00:00:29.600
4 terrible weeks of endless waiting and we
are finally back with fresh One Piece content.

00:00:29.600 --> 00:00:35.809
And just how the Yonko Saga has ended with
a massive bang, the new Laugh Tale Saga has

00:00:35.809 --> 00:00:38.490
just started off with an even bigger one.

00:00:38.490 --> 00:00:43.750
And of course the only correct way to start
is by addressing the man, the myth the living

00:00:43.750 --> 00:00:50.730
legend of One Piece, Shanks, who actually
has been in less than dozen chapters of one

00:00:50.730 --> 00:00:51.730
piece.

00:00:51.730 --> 00:00:58.730
In other words, whenever he is there, big
things are happening, and that's exactly what

00:00:58.730 --> 00:00:59.730
we got.

00:00:59.730 --> 00:01:05.710
Shanks is literally sailing in the waters
of wano, just a few miles from where Luffy

00:01:05.710 --> 00:01:09.270
is celebrating his victory with the citizens
right now.

00:01:09.270 --> 00:01:14.860
And, holy Usopp, there is so much going on
in the few panels he gets.

00:01:14.860 --> 00:01:20.500
First of all, Shanks reveals, that he will
not be meeting Luffy right now.

00:01:20.500 --> 00:01:21.780
Which is hilarious.

00:01:21.780 --> 00:01:27.550
Because I actually have a video coming out
in 2 or 3 days about why, when and where Shanks

00:01:27.550 --> 00:01:30.670
and Luffy will meet and what will most likely
happen.

00:01:30.670 --> 00:01:34.630
I said, that this meeting is going to happen
very soon, most likely on Elbaf.

00:01:34.630 --> 00:01:39.980
Then it was rumoured that Shanks was going
to be in this chapter close to wano, so I

00:01:39.980 --> 00:01:46.200
changed the script, only to read it and find
out that he's only doing a drive by around

00:01:46.200 --> 00:01:49.420
wano, which as you can imagine gave me some
headache.

00:01:49.420 --> 00:01:54.030
Anyways, I have a full video about what will
happen between Luffy and Shanks very soon.

00:01:54.030 --> 00:01:56.170
Make sure to subscribe if you don't want to
miss that.

00:01:56.170 --> 00:01:58.420
It's gonna blow your mind.

00:01:58.420 --> 00:02:00.600
But for now, let's focus on the chapter:

00:02:00.600 --> 00:02:06.210
I think we all have to accept, that the kind
and funny Shanks, that we got to know in early

00:02:06.210 --> 00:02:08.920
one piece is long gone.

00:02:08.920 --> 00:02:13.390
As we have learned throughout the story, with
shanks stopping kaido, stopping the war, meeting

00:02:13.390 --> 00:02:20.569
the Gorosei and so on, and as this chapter
confirms, Shanks is one of the most powerful

00:02:20.569 --> 00:02:23.549
pirates in the world and a master manipulator.

00:02:23.549 --> 00:02:28.700
He has been pulling strings and guiding the
events of the one piece world form behind

00:02:28.700 --> 00:02:34.319
the scenes, competing with the likes of Blackbeard
and the World Government to prepare for his

00:02:34.319 --> 00:02:37.879
dream of the future.

00:02:37.879 --> 00:02:44.590
I always took Shanks to be more of a pacifist,
someone who would try to avoid battle if possible.

00:02:44.590 --> 00:02:47.280
He doesn't fight Higuma until he threatens
Luffy.

00:02:47.280 --> 00:02:52.390
He stopped Kaido from turning the war at Marineford
into the apocalypse.

00:02:52.390 --> 00:02:54.790
He stopped the war completely.

00:02:54.790 --> 00:03:01.109
Overall it felt like he was a pretty peace
loving guy with enough power to back it up.

00:03:01.109 --> 00:03:06.700
That also gave Shanks a bit of a bad reputation
among fans, with many theorising that Shanks

00:03:06.700 --> 00:03:12.569
might be the weakest yonko and only has reached
this level through tricks.

00:03:12.569 --> 00:03:18.170
I think this chapter has turned this belief
completely on its head.

00:03:18.170 --> 00:03:24.200
Shanks comes across here as cold, calculated
and very much willing to to fight.

00:03:24.200 --> 00:03:29.390
It turns out that he indeed has a number of
territories in the new world, just like the

00:03:29.390 --> 00:03:35.930
other Yonko and that Bartolomeo burning his
flag and replacing it with Luffy's will have

00:03:35.930 --> 00:03:41.159
very serious repercussions for him, as many
people have predicted.

00:03:41.159 --> 00:03:44.340
Shanks is seriously coming for his head.

00:03:44.340 --> 00:03:48.269
And he doesn't sound all too happy that he
works under Luffy.

00:03:48.269 --> 00:03:50.719
'I need to take care of my credibility'.

00:03:50.719 --> 00:03:51.719
Damn.

00:03:51.719 --> 00:03:55.309
This really gave me shivers, I'm not gonna
lie.

00:03:55.309 --> 00:03:57.480
Shanks is the real deal.

00:03:57.480 --> 00:04:01.469
And Bartolomeo is in some serious trouble.

00:04:01.469 --> 00:04:03.879
And as if this weren't enough.

00:04:03.879 --> 00:04:09.609
Shanks also announces that it's time to join
the fight for the one piece.

00:04:09.609 --> 00:04:12.799
No more standing by and letting things develop.

00:04:12.799 --> 00:04:15.999
Shanks will now take the stage.

00:04:15.999 --> 00:04:22.270
No wonder Oda and his staff are so excited
for film red.

00:04:22.270 --> 00:04:27.699
This sounds like there is a lot of conflict
brewing between luffy and Shanks.

00:04:27.699 --> 00:04:33.419
Luffy's underling basically stole one of shanks'
islands and now he tells Ben Beckman it's

00:04:33.419 --> 00:04:35.970
time to join the fight for the one piece.

00:04:35.970 --> 00:04:39.920
A battle between the four yank for laugh tale.

00:04:39.920 --> 00:04:43.720
Luffy, Shanks, Buggy and Blackbeard.

00:04:43.720 --> 00:04:51.000
All of this brings up the old question whether
Shanks might not actually be a bad guy in

00:04:51.000 --> 00:04:52.000
disguise.

00:04:52.000 --> 00:04:54.160
Again, wait for my video on that in a few
days.

00:04:54.160 --> 00:05:00.790
But I think one really important hint we get
in this chapter, are Shanks' men.

00:05:00.790 --> 00:05:05.840
They are over the moon to read the news about
Luffy.

00:05:05.840 --> 00:05:10.050
They all are dying to meet Luffy in a really
positive way.

00:05:10.050 --> 00:05:12.099
Lucky too, Bonk Punch, Limejuice.

00:05:12.099 --> 00:05:18.860
They are all excited to finally reunite with
the boy they met so many years ago and had

00:05:18.860 --> 00:05:20.280
so much fun with.

00:05:20.280 --> 00:05:25.300
TO me, this indicates, that Shanks doesn't
shut up about about Luffy either.

00:05:25.300 --> 00:05:29.509
That all of the red hair pirates have been
eager to meet luffy.

00:05:29.509 --> 00:05:33.050
They all truly seem like Luffy's friends here.

00:05:33.050 --> 00:05:37.069
They are as surprised by Shanks not meeting
LUffy right now as we are.

00:05:37.069 --> 00:05:43.680
And so I think Shanks acting this way is just
Oda-sensei knowing exactly how to play with

00:05:43.680 --> 00:05:46.110
us by leaving this ambiguous.

00:05:46.110 --> 00:05:52.270
But really the only way Shanks could turn
out to be a bad guy, is if he had also fooled

00:05:52.270 --> 00:05:58.039
his crew, which, yes is not impossible, but
also not very likely.

00:05:58.039 --> 00:06:02.990
And I do want Shanks to be that secret weapon
Luffy can rely on.

00:06:02.990 --> 00:06:08.289
Then again, if Shanks actually does turn out
to only be using Luffy and that he's mostly

00:06:08.289 --> 00:06:13.419
in it for himself or some other reason, I
wouldn't be mad at all either.

00:06:13.419 --> 00:06:21.319
In truth, if I had to bet, the reality probably
falls somewhere in between.

00:06:21.319 --> 00:06:28.020
Shanks is an ally and cares for Luffy, but
he has a higher purpose as well, that comes

00:06:28.020 --> 00:06:29.240
before that.

00:06:29.240 --> 00:06:34.870
I think Shanks might well turn out to be one
of the most morally complex and interesting

00:06:34.870 --> 00:06:38.050
characters in the entire story at the end.

00:06:38.050 --> 00:06:43.389
I absolutely love that little flashback to
the very first chapter of the story that we

00:06:43.389 --> 00:06:46.830
get and a look at Shanks stealing the Nika
fruit.

00:06:46.830 --> 00:06:52.960
It was already pretty much obvious, that Shanks
knew exactly what he was doing there and what

00:06:52.960 --> 00:06:59.379
that fruit really was, but it's nonetheless
giving me goosebumps, seeing it drawn and

00:06:59.379 --> 00:07:01.889
how he reacts to Luffy's awakening.

00:07:01.889 --> 00:07:07.880
It's almost as if Luffy awakening the Nika
fruit was the signal shanks has been waiting

00:07:07.880 --> 00:07:10.580
for to launch the race for laugh tale.

00:07:10.580 --> 00:07:15.900
I'm also incredibly excited to finally see
all of the red hair pirates in action.

00:07:15.900 --> 00:07:19.639
Especially Lucky Roo and Ben Beckman.

00:07:19.639 --> 00:07:25.409
And I love that Yasopp is not emotionally
prepared to face his son yet, that he abandoned

00:07:25.409 --> 00:07:29.159
as a kid back in Syrup village.

00:07:29.159 --> 00:07:36.860
I'm gonna remind you that no one in Shanks'
crew has eaten a devil fruit for some mysterious

00:07:36.860 --> 00:07:39.990
reason, most likely related to the one piece.

00:07:39.990 --> 00:07:46.919
In other words, this is a yonko crew purely
based on power and skill alone, which is really

00:07:46.919 --> 00:07:49.419
as impressive as it gets.

00:07:49.419 --> 00:07:56.229
The only thing I'm curious about is why shanks
was hanging around Wano in the first place,

00:07:56.229 --> 00:07:57.990
if he didn't want to see Luffy.

00:07:57.990 --> 00:07:59.860
Did he come for Pluton?

00:07:59.860 --> 00:08:06.569
However what is even more likely is actually
that Shanks came for Kaido's poneglpyh.

00:08:06.569 --> 00:08:12.349
After all Shanks hasn't been to laugh tale
before, so maybe he needed that one for his

00:08:12.349 --> 00:08:13.789
collection too.

00:08:13.789 --> 00:08:17.380
That would actually make a ton of sense.

00:08:17.380 --> 00:08:21.249
What would be even more hilarious of course,
would be if Shanks didn't possess the last

00:08:21.249 --> 00:08:26.900
road poneglyph at all, but now has Kaido's
because the straw hats were too slow to actually

00:08:26.900 --> 00:08:27.900
get it.

00:08:27.900 --> 00:08:32.409
Someone else who has made use of Kaido's defeat
and is very much eager to meet Luffy in person

00:08:32.409 --> 00:08:34.250
on the other hand is greenbull.

00:08:34.250 --> 00:08:40.050
I still can't shake the feeling that he might
actually be FROM Wano, I went in detail on

00:08:40.050 --> 00:08:46.620
why in this video right here, but this chapter
focuses mostly on him being even more of a

00:08:46.620 --> 00:08:49.720
beast than we have already seen.

00:08:49.720 --> 00:08:54.680
Kinemon and the remaining scabbards notice
him moving toward the capital and decide to

00:08:54.680 --> 00:08:58.300
stop him before he can disturb Luffy and the
straw hats.

00:08:58.300 --> 00:09:01.850
Ryokugyuu really hits home the fact that he's
a real dough.

00:09:01.850 --> 00:09:06.769
He gives Kinemon and co a big speech about
the world order and how you need to discriminate

00:09:06.769 --> 00:09:11.370
in order to make the world work, for the celestial
dragon that is of course.

00:09:11.370 --> 00:09:13.680
Sounds like he's projecting a little bit here.

00:09:13.680 --> 00:09:19.060
However the power he unleashes is absolutely
ridiculous.

00:09:19.060 --> 00:09:26.750
I really don't want to know how crazy a battle
between two of the admirals might look.

00:09:26.750 --> 00:09:29.780
This is just ridiculous.

00:09:29.780 --> 00:09:35.690
Actually scratch that, there is nothing I
want more than seeing two admirals fight.

00:09:35.690 --> 00:09:40.040
I actually made the argument in my greenbull
video, that Aramaki might very well be a logia

00:09:40.040 --> 00:09:45.000
fruit user, which is confirmed surprisingly
fast here.

00:09:45.000 --> 00:09:50.589
The fact that he calls himself a force of
nature and compares his forest to the sea

00:09:50.589 --> 00:09:55.170
raises two incredibly interesting possibilities
for me:

00:09:55.170 --> 00:10:00.760
One, since Greenbull falls in line with all
the other admirals devil fruit powers, I think

00:10:00.760 --> 00:10:05.450
we should assume that Fujitora's devil fruit
also is a logia, though I couldn'T really

00:10:05.450 --> 00:10:09.690
tell you how that makes any sense.

00:10:09.690 --> 00:10:15.770
And two, Aramaki has just pushed the door
wide open for a sea logia devil fruit.

00:10:15.770 --> 00:10:21.800
Like, I can't be the only one that takes this
line as some possible foreshadowing for this?

00:10:21.800 --> 00:10:28.990
The ultimate devil fruit, possibly in the
possession of Imu, who's name is Umi in return,

00:10:28.990 --> 00:10:32.459
which literally means ocean in Japanese.

00:10:32.459 --> 00:10:36.540
I think this theory has gotten quite a boost
with this statement.

00:10:36.540 --> 00:10:39.139
Then Yamato and Momo step in.

00:10:39.139 --> 00:10:44.459
And oh boy, all the people who doubted where
Yamato would be ranked inside the straw hats,

00:10:44.459 --> 00:10:47.339
I think it's pretty close to the top.

00:10:47.339 --> 00:10:52.930
The fact that she can knock this monster down
like this and Ryokugyuu mentions how powerful

00:10:52.930 --> 00:10:56.190
her haki is, it warms my heart.

00:10:56.190 --> 00:11:01.779
Yamato has really become my favorite character
in the series tougher with Zoro at this point,

00:11:01.779 --> 00:11:03.610
maybe even a little bit more.

00:11:03.610 --> 00:11:09.660
And seeing her handing it to one of the most
powerful people in the world, is just so so

00:11:09.660 --> 00:11:11.000
satisfying to see.

00:11:11.000 --> 00:11:15.100
I'm really curious how momo will hold up against
him 1v1.

00:11:15.100 --> 00:11:21.230
Momo has grown a lot throughout the raid on
Onigashima, physically and mentally.

00:11:21.230 --> 00:11:27.180
But as his failed Boro breath shows us, he
is far form actually being on Kaido's level

00:11:27.180 --> 00:11:28.490
with his devil fruit.

00:11:28.490 --> 00:11:31.790
Then there is the entire Sabo situation.

00:11:31.790 --> 00:11:38.680
It is reassuring to hear that it was Cobra
after all and not Vivi that has been killed,

00:11:38.680 --> 00:11:42.269
and that Sabo has not been captured to start
a second marineford.

00:11:42.269 --> 00:11:48.829
I am really fascinated by the new character
we are introduced to: Head of the Marine Criminal

00:11:48.829 --> 00:11:53.190
Investigation Service, Kurouma, which means
black horse.

00:11:53.190 --> 00:11:58.440
Not only does this introduce an entirely new
branch of the marines to us, but I'm very

00:11:58.440 --> 00:12:04.860
much intrigued by the fact, that this man
follows the naming scheme of the other admirals.

00:12:04.860 --> 00:12:09.280
Color plus animal: Black horse.

00:12:09.280 --> 00:12:15.140
Correct me if I'm wrong, but it sounds a lot
like Oda just dropped another admiral level

00:12:15.140 --> 00:12:18.180
character out of nowhere into the story.

00:12:18.180 --> 00:12:19.889
And I'm all for it.

00:12:19.889 --> 00:12:26.181
The real question is of course, what has happened
to Sabo and Vivi, but luckily for you, you

00:12:26.181 --> 00:12:30.920
don't have to wonder about that at all, because
I have already made an entire video about

00:12:30.920 --> 00:12:34.869
exactly that, that seems to have hit the nail
on its head.

